
 maglinux RESCUE system (Debian 12, read-only squashfs + RAM overlay)
 All changes are lost on reboot.

 Boot partition (read-only):  /media/sdcard
 Main system image:           /media/sdcard/rootfs.btrfs

 Inspect / repair the main system:
   mount -o remount,rw /media/sdcard
   mkdir -p /mnt/root && mount -o loop /media/sdcard/rootfs.btrfs /mnt/root
   btrfs check /media/sdcard/rootfs.btrfs      (only while NOT mounted)

